# Accuenergy AcuVim-L.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Accuenergy AcuVim-L — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: accuenergy-acuvim-l-modbus.pdf
# | - 3-phase advanced power quality meter, DIN-rail mount.
# | - FC03 (Read Holding Registers) for all registers listed here.
# | - Two measurement banks; this TOML uses the primary Float bank (0x0600H) exclusively:
# | real-time in IEEE 754 float32, SI units — no CT/PT-ratio scaling needed.
# | - THD bank at 0x0400H (1024 decimal): u16, real = Rx/10000×100% → scale=0.01 %.
# | - Energy bank at 0x0156H (342 decimal): u32 Dword, real = Rx/10 → scale=0.1 kWh.
# | - All addresses are raw protocol addresses.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N1.
